### OBTENER TODOS LOS PRODUCTOS 
GET http://localhost:3001/api/products

### OBTENER PRODUCTO POR ID
GET http://localhost:3001/api/products/6a697b89100b41cc293330b3

### CREAR PRODUCTO
POST http://localhost:3001/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Tacos Mexicanos",
    "description": "Tortillas de maíz rellenas con carne al pastor, cebolla, cilantro y piña, servidas con salsa picante al gusto.",
    "price": 18,
    "stock": 15,
    "imageUrl": "https://res.cloudinary.com/uz3ydaj6/image/upload/v1785296771/tacos_m7nuih.png"
}

### ACTUALIZAR PRODUCTO
PUT http://localhost:3001/api/products/6a6980b9087782c596b0c8a2
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "price": 15
}

### ELIMINAR PRODUCTO
DELETE  http://localhost:3001/api/products/6a698380b210ea7ed07bd492

### ----------------------------------------

### ADD TO CART
POST http://localhost:3001/api/cart/add
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "userId": "6a6a5e39d55b4b33860258a6",
    "productId": "6a698453b210ea7ed07bd493",
    "quantity": 4
}

### GET CART
GET  http://localhost:3001/api/cart/get/6a6a5e39d55b4b33860258a6

### UPDATE CART
PUT http://localhost:3001/api/cart/update/6a6a5e39d55b4b33860258a6
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "productId": "6a698453b210ea7ed07bd493",
    "quantity": 3
}

### DELETE PRODUCT FROM CART
DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/cart/removeProduct/6a6980b9087782c596b0c8a2
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "productId": "6a6980b9087782c596b0c8a2"
}

### CLEAR CART
DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/cart/clear/6a6a5e39d55b4b33860258a6
Content-Type: application/json

### GET CART TOTAL
GET http://localhost:3001/api/cart/total/6a6a5e39d55b4b33860258a6

